{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人呂慧儀（長腳蟹）與馬貫東今日（26日）獲無綫頒發20年服務獎，長腳蟹表示兩人一齊獲10年服務獎，當年她已尊稱早她兩個月入行的馬貫東為前輩，而對方亦是她在《愛•回家之開心速遞》中第一個拍檔CP，好開心共同進步，兩人約定繼續拼搏 ，10年後</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:03:53.482662+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:14:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:14.356451+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:14.356451+00:00","content_hash":"f0ec65f202c3f622fd712ab53de88b491d17e46b06dc01819048f90f182bfcc3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}